[h2]GunGame[/h2]
Score kills to advance through a weapon ladder. In free-for-all, each player has their own ladder. In Team GunGame, both teams have a shared ladder for their side. The first player or team to clear the ladder wins. The HUD shows the leaders and the next weapons.

[list]
[*]Choose one of 44 Altis layouts or select Random. Set the arena size separately.
[*]Pick a full, half or short ladder. Use a mixed ladder or choose assault rifles, sniper rifles, machine guns, close-quarters weapons or pistols.
[*]Require one, two or three kills per weapon. The host can make suicides cost a ladder step.
[*]Set AI skill and fill to a fixed player count or scale it to the arena. AI can be turned off.
[*]The map shows your own unit in free-for-all. In team mode it can also draw your side.
[/list]

The lobby also sets weather, start time, time multipliers, night skip and third-person view. The mission includes Killfeed, Earplugs, Jump, Holster, Auto Heal, Disable Stamina, Disable Tactical View, Map Marker and Magazine Repack.

[h2]Start the scenario[/h2]
Host the scenario in multiplayer and open Parameters in the lobby.

